#N Latch (Carlini, Part 2)
#O Nicholas Carlini, 2020
#C A loop through an OR and an AND. A pulse into the OR sets it and the gliders go round for good; a pulse into the AND's NOT clears it. Here a slow clock sets and clears it again and again.
